{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44577","headline":"诗三百三首 二七四 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二七四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆得二十年，徐步国清归。\n国清寺中人，尽道寒山痴。\n痴人何用疑，疑不解寻思。\n我尚自不识，是伊争得知。\n低头不用问，问得复何爲。\n有人来駡我，分明了了知。\n虽然不应对，却是得便宜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}